# Ezinhle Hair Care

Website for Ezinhle Hair Care, a South African natural hair-care brand.

## Current Product

- Shea Avo Butter — 125ml

## Status

Pre-launch website concept.

## Tech

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Project Goals

- Present the Ezinhle Hair Care brand
- Showcase the Shea Avo Butter product
- Provide a foundation for future e-commerce functionality